how to find your one word I mentioned in  a few of my videos that I think it's  important for entrepreneurs to get down  to one word that describes who they are  as a person and then bring that to your  business and for me I have the word  believe I believe in people and I apply  that to entrepreneurs and so when I'm  making decisions about what I'm gonna do  with my company it has to be things that  are around believing believing in  entrepreneurs and that makes it easy for  you to make decisions but it also makes  it easy for people to talk about you  because chances are you're not doing a  great job of marketing yourself you're  making it hard for people to spread the  message about you and you're not  bringing yourself fully to your business  when you have a one word message that  it's easy to share people will share it  they'll feel it they'll want to spread  the word if they believe the same thing  as you do so I got a question from one  of my youtube viewers and a great guy  who's who have talked a few times and  he's translated some of my videos in the  Spanish Arturo who wrote in to say what  happens when you have too many words and  can't decide so Arturo this video is for  you and what I'm gonna do is break down  how I got to my word believe' and this  is gonna be a little bit unfiltered I  haven't fully worked out the process as  an educational tool it's more just a  dump of the process that I went through  and hopefully you can learn from that it  started when I watched the movie job so  I loved Steve Jobs big fan of Steve Jobs  I went to see the movie Jobs and there  are a couple points in that movie where  I got the feeling of being excited and  you know that feeling you know the  feeling when you watch a movie or you  listen to a great song and you just you  get that feeling you get that feeling of  excitement and energy and you want to go  do something when you watch a movie like  jobs at least for me I felt I wanted to  go and do something make make my  business better you know you get that  sometimes when you're at a motivational  speech or you hear somebody talk or you  read a great book maybe you're watching  my videos you know you want to  get out there and take action and do  something and so I wanted something that  that could represent that for me I  wanted people that get that feeling when  they came to my website and learned  about me before all this my tagline was  over 14 million entrepreneurs helped and  Counting and adventure grew that over 20  million entrepreneurs helped in counting  and that was just a number of people who  have visited my website and I thought  and that's like that's like the  McDonald's slogan you know you walk down  you see McDonald's says how many  billions served and I thought that added  some credibility but that's not  something that people talk about right  nobody says oh Evans helped 20 million  entrepreneurs after I watched the movie  i sat down with Jason Vaughn seco who's  joined me and we've done some great  collaborations together and we tried to  come down to one sentence and the  sentence that we came down to let me  find it here actually have a document  that maybe I can show you guys is hungry  entrepreneurs deserve help and I was  trying to narrow down my focus to make a  message that people could talk about and  this was something that Jason was a big  believer in and I got it down to hungry  entrepreneurs deserve help because it  explains the type of people who I wanted  to work with which was entrepreneurs  we're not just any entrepreneurs as  hungry entrepreneurs you know you'd want  to help the people were just sitting  there don't take action and I feel like  they deserve help and and I like helping  people and that and I feel like it's so  hard to be an entrepreneur that if you  are hungry and you're trying to make a  difference in this world you deserve to  be helped so something that I believed  in and that's the sense as we got down  to and Jason is going on is like wow  that's too long you know it's too many  syllables it's hard to share but let's  start with that and then I did some work  on my own I'm just trying to figure out  how to make that sentence shorter and  more impactful so I got the feeling and  I just made a list I just wrote down  some of the things that that got me  excited about my business I didn't know  where it was going it just did kind of a  dump so this would be the equivalent of  making a list of words so what I wrote  down was what I do what I believe but  not inspirational enough so that that  wasn't inspirational enough that  sentence so I put entrepreneurs change  the world entrepreneurs a heroes  celebrate entrepreneurs have  rallying cry gets your heart pumping and  then I tried to get to actually words  that that I could use as part of my  slogan so it's on you take your shot  believe follow your passion overcome  persevere keep going step up don't  settle start all kind of shorter and  more powerful more impactful words and I  settled on nothing at the end of that  day I looked at that list like I like  them all I don't know where I'm going  with this and I came back the next day  and I liked the word believe we just  kind of stuck with me and from there I  kind of expanded it to believe in what  you're doing which is passion believe  that you can do it which is confidence  and believe that it will work out with  conviction and that thought will believe  it's too short like I got to make it  longer I was fighting I was fighting how  short it was and so I came up with  believe you came believe in the possible  believe more believe it all believe in  belief believe and believe I was trying  to come up with something else and I got  frustrated with all of these and thought  that believe was the best one on that  list and it just kind of gave me the  confidence to say you know what I'm just  gonna I'm gonna stick with belief and  every thing I've done since then since  that day has been about believe and I've  updated my bio if you go to my my social  media BIOS that just says I believe I  hash tag believe in entrepreneurs it  just makes things so much easier it's  easier for people to spread the message  you see it at the end of the videos you  see how I talk about all the time and so  that's the process I went through again  I started with something I wanted to be  moving exciting passion something that I  looked at and got excited by I wrote  down a whole list of ideas and I just  left it for the day I came back the next  day and found the one that kind of  smoked me most and looked on different  variations variations of that and then  ended up with with just the one word and  and since then I've loved it and I've  used it every day and and it's helped me  make decisions for my business so  hopefully our true that helped to answer  your question maybe in the future as I  as I come with a more refined process  we'll make another video for you guys  but if you guys like this video you want  to see more give it a thumbs up below  you have a question  for me and you have a comment leave it  below I make a video response and if you  want to subscribe to the channel you can  click on my face there at the top left  hand corner or top right hand corner for  you left hand corner for me so thank you  and I'll see you soon
 

